---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;

const pageTitle = "Wholesale Clothing Manufacturer | Bulk Production";
const pageDescription = "Manufacture wholesale clothing with SDF's bulk production. We specialize in bulk garment manufacturing for global fashion brands.";
const schema = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": pageTitle,
    "description": pageDescription,
    "author": { "@id": "https://sdfltd.com/#org" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://sdfltd.com/#org" },
    "url": "https://sdfltd.com/insights/wholesale-clothing-manufacturer/",
    "mainEntityOfPage": "https://sdfltd.com/insights/wholesale-clothing-manufacturer/"
  }
];

---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} schema={schema}>

  <div class="container" style="padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;">

    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <p style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: #FFFFFF; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">
        <a href="/" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
        <span style="margin: 0 0.5rem; color: #333;">›</span>
        <a href="/insights/index" style="color: #aaa; text-decoration: none;">Insights</a>
        <span style="margin: 0 0.5rem; color: #333;">›</span>
        <span style="color: #FFFFFF;">Wholesale Clothing Manufacturer</span>
      </p>
    </nav>

    <article>

      <header style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;">
        <span style="font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #e00; display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Wholesale Guide</span>
        <h1 style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 200; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.01em;">
          Wholesale Clothing Manufacturing — How to Source Bulk Garments from Bangladesh
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0;">
          Wholesale clothing manufacturing means ordering garments in bulk directly from a factory, not through a middleman or importer. Buying wholesale from a Bangladesh clothing manufacturer gives you factory-direct pricing, full control over product specification, and the ability to build a long-term supply relationship. This guide covers everything wholesale buyers need to know.
        </p>
      </header>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">What Is Wholesale Clothing Manufacturing?</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Wholesale manufacturing is when a brand or retailer orders garments in bulk directly from the factory. You are the importer and handle shipping, import duty, and customs clearance. The factory provides export documentation. Wholesale is different from buying from a marketplace — you control everything from fabric to label.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Wholesale Pricing</h2>
      <div style="background: #050505; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; border-left: 0.6px solid #e00; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Basic t-shirt (180gsm):</strong> $2.80-4.00 per piece</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Polo shirt (220gsm):</strong> $4.50-6.50 per piece</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Hoodie (380gsm):</strong> $7.00-11.00 per piece</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Dress shirt (poplin):</strong> $5.50-8.50 per piece</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Denim jeans (10oz):</strong> $8.00-14.00 per piece</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;"><strong style="color: #fff;">Bomber jacket:</strong> $12.00-20.00 per piece</p>
      </div>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">MOQ for Wholesale Orders</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Small factories: 300-500 pieces. Mid-size: 500-1,000 pieces. Large: 3,000-10,000 pieces. For most wholesale buyers, the 300-1,000 piece range offers the best combination of price and flexibility.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Payment Terms</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Standard: 30% deposit to start production, 70% balance before shipment. Alternative for established buyers: letter of credit (L/C) for large orders. Never pay 100% upfront to a factory you have not worked with before.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Quality Control</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Three stages: pre-production (sample approval), during production (in-line inspection), final inspection (AQL 2.5 standard). For orders above 1,000 pieces or new factories, third-party inspection by SGS, Bureau Veritas, or Intertek is recommended.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Wholesale Shipping</h2>
      <div style="background: #050505; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; border-left: 0.6px solid #e00; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">To UK (Felixstowe):</strong> 22-27 days</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">To Germany (Hamburg):</strong> 20-25 days</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">To USA (Los Angeles):</strong> 25-30 days</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong style="color: #fff;">To Australia (Melbourne):</strong> 28-35 days</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;"><strong style="color: #fff;">To Canada (Vancouver):</strong> 28-32 days</p>
      </div>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Import Duty</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">EU buyers: zero duty under EBA. UK buyers: zero under UK GSP. USA buyers: 16-17% duty. Australia: 0-5% under AANZFTA. Canada: variable rates with CETA preferential treatment.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Building Long-Term Relationships</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Pay on time. Provide clear feedback after each order. Give advance notice of upcoming orders. Consolidate styles. Visit your factory.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Why Bangladesh for Wholesale?</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Bangladesh is the second-largest garment exporter. For EU and UK buyers, duty-free access means lower landed cost than China. More LEED-certified green factories than any other country. GOTS, OEKO-TEX, and BSCI certifications widely available.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; border-top: 0.6px solid #e00; background: #050505; margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p style="color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 300;">
          Looking for a wholesale clothing manufacturer in Bangladesh? Request a wholesale quote from SDF Clothing. Tell us your garment type, quantity, and destination market. We will send FOB pricing, duty savings calculation, and lead time within 48 hours. MOQ 300 pieces.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" style="display: inline-block; background: #e00; color: #fff; padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: background 0.2s;">
          Request Quote ?
        </a>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; margin-top: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        For a complete overview of clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh — including factory types, MOQ ranges, certifications, and sourcing guide — read our <a href="/clothing-manufacturers" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">complete clothing manufacturers guide</a>.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#aaa; margin-top:1.75rem; line-height:1.85;">
        For a complete overview of clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh — including factory types, MOQ ranges, certifications, sourcing methods, and product categories — read our <a href="/clothing-manufacturers" style="color:#e00; text-decoration:none;">complete clothing manufacturers guide</a>.
      </p>

    </article>

  </div>

    
    </BaseLayout>




